  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "Apart from the value back, what sets this card apart from the base variant is that it offers complimentary domestic and international lounge visits every year. Additionally, cardholders can also redeem the reward points against air miles and travel bookings through the SmartBuy portal at a 2:1 ratio, which is good, especially considering this is a co-branded credit card. Also, similar to the base variant, this card surpasses its joining fee of Rs. 4,500 by offering a complimentary Shoppers Stop Black Membership worth Rs. 4,500 and a Shoppers Stop discount voucher worth Rs. 1,500 as welcome benefits. Consumers who frequently shop at Shoppers Stop can maximize the benefits of this card. However, if you frequently travel, you can also save on your travel spends through this card via complimentary lounge access and redemption of rewards against travel bookings.",
