    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "Who is eligible for Shoppers Stop Black HDFC Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "To apply for this credit card, your age must be between 21 and 65 years. Besides this, if you are a salaried individual, you must have a monthly income of Rs. 70,000, and for self-employed individuals, the annual income requirement is Rs. 8.4 LPA."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does HDFC Bank Shoppers Stop Black Credit Card have lounge access benefits?",
        "a": "Yes, the card offers 16 complimentary domestic lounge visits per year, with a maximum of 4 visits per quarter, and 8 complimentary international lounge visits every year, with a maximum of 2 visits per quarter."
      },
      {
        "q": "How can I apply for HDFC Shoppers Stop Black Credit Card?",
        "a": "You can apply for this credit card online by visiting the official website of HDFC Bank and submitting the duly filled application form along with the required documents. Besides this, if you want to apply offline, you can visit the nearest branch of HDFC Bank and contact an executive regarding the offline application process."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Shoppers Stop Black HDFC Bank Credit Card offer a fuel surcharge waiver?",
        "a": "Yes, you can avail 1% fuel surcharge waiver on fuel spends between Rs. 400 and Rs. 5,000. You can earn a maximum waiver of Rs. 500 per month."
      },
      {
        "q": "Is there any capping on reward points earned via Shoppers Stop Black HDFC Bank Credit Card?",
        "a": "Yes, you can earn 7% rewards on Shoppers Stop spends, with a monthly capping of 2,000 points, and 1% rewards on other spends, with a monthly capping of 2,000 points."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does Shoppers Stop Black HDFC Bank Credit Card offer an annual fee waiver?",
        "a": "No, Shoppers Stop HDFC Bank Credit Card does not offer an annual fee waiver. You are required to pay an annual fee of Rs. 4,500 every year."
      }
    ]
  },
